  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><h1 data-start=\"97\" data-end=\"131\" id=\"isPasted\">Mutty Prints Affiliate Program</h1><p data-start=\"132\" data-end=\"179\"><strong data-start=\"132\" data-end=\"179\">Earn 10% Commission on Every Sale You Drive</strong></p><h3 data-start=\"181\" data-end=\"213\">About Our Brand &amp; Products</h3><p data-start=\"214\" data-end=\"615\">Mutty Prints is a fun, cheeky, dog-loving apparel and accessories brand created for rescue-minded dog moms and pet parents. From graphic tees and cozy hats to mugs and stickers, every product is designed with a bold, trendy aesthetic—and every purchase helps support animal shelters across the country. We regularly partner with rescues and donate up to <strong data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"586\">50% of profits</strong> to their life-saving work.&nbsp;</p><h3 data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"646\">What Makes Us Different</h3><ul data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"1016\"><li data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"736\"><p data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"736\"><strong data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"668\">Mission-Driven:</strong> We’re not just a clothing brand—we’re a movement for rescue dogs.</p></li><li data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"867\"><p data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"867\"><strong data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"769\">Trendy, Shareable Designs:</strong> Our products combine fashion with humor and heart, built for social sharing and community love.</p></li><li data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"1016\"><p data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"1016\"><strong data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"893\">Philanthropy First:</strong> Every month, we spotlight a new rescue partner and give back 5% of profits directly. Affiliates get to be part of this bigger purpose.</p></li></ul><h3 data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1047\">How Affiliates Can Earn</h3><ul data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1382\"><li data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1140\"><p data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1140\"><strong data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1065\">Commission:</strong> Earn <strong data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1092\">10% of every sale</strong> you drive—uncapped, recurring, and trackable.</p></li><li data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1242\"><p data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1242\"><strong data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1169\">High-Quality Products:</strong> With average order values between $30–$60, commissions add up quickly.</p></li><li data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1382\"><p data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1382\"><strong data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1270\">Exclusive Promotions:</strong> Access to new product drops, seasonal launches, and limited-edition collaborations to boost conversion rates.</p></li></ul><h3 data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1407\">How to Promote Us</h3><ul data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1811\"><li data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1481\"><p data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1481\">Share affiliate links on <strong data-start=\"1435\" data-end=\"1478\">Instagram, TikTok, Pinterest, and blogs</strong>.</p></li><li data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1567\"><p data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1567\">Incorporate Mutty Prints into <strong data-start=\"1514\" data-end=\"1565\">lifestyle content, unboxings, and outfit inspo.</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1678\"><p data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1678\">Highlight our <strong data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1636\">rescue partnerships and monthly donation efforts</strong> to connect with your audience’s values.</p></li><li data-start=\"1679\" data-end=\"1811\"><p data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1811\">Use our <strong data-start=\"1689\" data-end=\"1720\">ready-to-go creative assets</strong> (banners, product photos, graphics) or put your own spin on our fun, cheeky brand voice.</p></li></ul><h3 data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1836\">Other Information</h3><ul data-start=\"1837\" data-end=\"2153\"><li data-start=\"1837\" data-end=\"1867\"><p data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1867\"><strong data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1857\">Cookie Window:</strong> 